WEBVTT

00:18.420 --> 00:22.980
(Peace)

00:28.220 --> 00:29.740
(Peace)

00:29.760 --> 00:31.030
According to our father's decree,

00:31.152 --> 00:32.710
now that you've reclaimed Yunzhou City,

00:33.000 --> 00:34.430
you are the Crown Prince of Daxing.

00:34.710 --> 00:35.640
Congratulations, Qian.

00:35.900 --> 00:39.220
(Prince Qian)
(Young Emperor Youning)

00:42.200 --> 00:43.470
Reclaiming our ancestral land

00:43.600 --> 00:45.430
is the duty of us Xiao descendants.

00:46.320 --> 00:48.280
It was also won
with the lives of our soldiers.

00:48.280 --> 00:49.750
The credit is not mine alone.

00:49.872 --> 00:51.320
From now on, in the imperial court,

00:51.328 --> 00:53.070
to govern the state
and ensure its peace,

00:53.472 --> 00:55.390
we brothers will still need
to work together.

00:58.430 --> 00:59.110
Qian,

00:59.560 --> 01:00.320
my...

01:00.470 --> 01:02.470
My birth mother was of low status,

01:02.750 --> 01:03.880
and she passed away too soon.

01:03.936 --> 01:05.630
I was fortunate
to receive the Empress's affection,

01:05.640 --> 01:06.680
and she raised me herself.

01:06.870 --> 01:07.840
How could I ever dare,

01:07.870 --> 01:10.230
and I have never coveted the throne.

01:16.150 --> 01:17.870
Since you were four and came to my side,

01:18.230 --> 01:20.230
I've never treated you as an outsider.

01:22.510 --> 01:24.950
This is a sachet Mother prayed for
at Fahua Temple.

01:25.070 --> 01:26.350
I've put mugwort leaf,

01:26.368 --> 01:28.130
angelica, borneol,
and Chinese gall inside.

01:28.640 --> 01:29.400
Keep it.

01:29.680 --> 01:30.400
Qian,

01:30.920 --> 01:32.040
I can't accept this.

01:33.350 --> 01:35.430
Wearing it will keep you safe.

01:36.200 --> 01:37.350
If you ever get injured,

01:37.424 --> 01:38.870
you can also use it for emergencies.

01:43.680 --> 01:44.120
Take it.

03:12.860 --> 03:13.616
=Blossoms of Power=

03:13.616 --> 03:16.460
(Adapted from the novel, After My
Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

03:16.540 --> 03:19.500
=Episode 16=

03:22.710 --> 03:23.800
Regarding today's events,

03:24.000 --> 03:25.664
I thank Your Highness

03:25.712 --> 03:26.840
and Commandery Princess.

03:32.310 --> 03:32.910
Yunhuai,

03:34.608 --> 03:36.304
there's no need for such formalities.

03:37.310 --> 03:38.590
You did it all for us,

03:38.590 --> 03:40.280
going to the Duke of Xie's Manor alone.

03:40.710 --> 03:43.280
It gave us the chance to coordinate
from the inside and out

03:43.344 --> 03:45.456
to find the secret room
and capture the Duke of Ying.

03:45.560 --> 03:46.960
We have you to thank for everything.

03:48.800 --> 03:49.560
Physician Xie,

03:49.584 --> 03:52.048
I'll escort you back to
your private estate in the suburbs.

03:52.050 --> 03:54.180
The carriage is already waiting
outside the city gate.

03:54.208 --> 03:54.768
Please.

04:02.310 --> 04:03.800
When we work together,

04:04.960 --> 04:06.030
with just a single glance,

04:06.080 --> 04:07.470
we understand each other completely.

04:08.120 --> 04:08.910
Without a word,

04:09.360 --> 04:11.030
we can anticipate
each other's next move.

04:12.960 --> 04:14.430
We're perfectly in sync.

04:14.840 --> 04:15.800
A match made in heaven.

04:16.112 --> 04:18.720
Perhaps it's just that we're both
skilled at precise calculations.

04:18.784 --> 04:20.384
It has nothing to do with anything else.

04:20.720 --> 04:22.360
For a companion you know and love,

04:22.464 --> 04:24.430
isn't understanding
and chemistry what one seeks?

04:27.360 --> 04:28.750
You took the Duke of Ying away.

04:28.896 --> 04:30.240
When will we interrogate him?

04:30.560 --> 04:32.570
He has indeed been
afflicted with a strange poison.

04:32.864 --> 04:34.070
He also had a bit of a scare.

04:34.176 --> 04:35.750
He needs a day or two to recuperate.

04:36.310 --> 04:37.160
When the time comes,

04:37.344 --> 04:39.190
I will personally go
to Duke of Wei's Manor

04:39.280 --> 04:40.960
to pick you up so we can go together.

04:42.300 --> 04:44.780
(Liquor)

05:09.950 --> 05:10.830
You like the rain.

05:12.096 --> 05:13.630
Let's watch it a little longer then.

05:16.160 --> 05:22.270
♪In the warm days, a gentle breeze
blows open the blossoms on a tree♪

05:23.130 --> 05:26.370
♪How else would I think of someone?♪

05:26.620 --> 05:29.730
♪A faint taste of longing on my lips♪

05:30.250 --> 05:32.320
♪Like a thousand twists and turns♪

05:32.320 --> 05:37.250
♪Gone forever,
yet I savor the memory again and again♪

05:44.020 --> 05:50.060
(Duke of Wei's Manor)

06:02.630 --> 06:03.870
Your Highness, what's wrong?

06:05.552 --> 06:07.328
After getting caught
in the rain that day,

06:07.344 --> 06:08.680
not only did I catch a cold,

06:09.000 --> 06:10.140
but I also developed a fever.

06:11.456 --> 06:12.704
If you don't believe me,

06:12.880 --> 06:14.640
feel for yourself, Commandery Princess.

06:25.472 --> 06:27.370
Thank you for your concern,
Commandery Princess.

06:41.160 --> 06:42.680
Did you imprison the Duke of Ying

06:42.800 --> 06:43.830
in the capital's suburbs?

06:44.160 --> 06:44.920
Of course.

06:45.310 --> 06:46.430
I couldn't possibly

06:46.480 --> 06:48.304
bring a living person
into the East Palace.

06:48.630 --> 06:50.240
Forget one living person,

06:50.680 --> 06:52.600
even if it were ten living people,

06:52.800 --> 06:53.920
if you wanted to,

06:54.070 --> 06:54.800
you could do it.

06:56.310 --> 06:58.190
I never thought that in your heart,

06:59.190 --> 07:00.830
I am so incredibly capable.

07:11.830 --> 07:13.430
The road ahead is uneven. Be careful.

07:14.190 --> 07:14.830
Don't worry.

07:14.830 --> 07:16.832
My riding skills are one of a kind
in the palace.

07:30.160 --> 07:31.240
One of a kind, really?

07:31.240 --> 07:32.720
Do you even know how? Let me do it.

07:40.360 --> 07:41.680
I've always been frail.

07:42.120 --> 07:43.720
I can't endure such a bumpy ride.

08:09.240 --> 08:10.360
You all wait here.

08:17.180 --> 08:21.980
(Gazing at the Mountain From Afar)

08:24.720 --> 08:26.272
I hope you find the real culprit today

08:26.320 --> 08:28.190
and solve this long-standing mystery.

08:28.510 --> 08:30.560
All the evidence points
to the Duke of Ying.

08:31.510 --> 08:33.200
This is indeed, in all these years,

08:33.264 --> 08:34.910
the closest I've ever been to the truth.

08:36.440 --> 08:37.320
Thank you

08:37.510 --> 08:38.510
for joining me in this.

09:14.870 --> 09:16.670
Your Highness,

09:16.750 --> 09:18.790
you are truly formidable.

09:19.790 --> 09:22.670
No one ever took you seriously.

09:23.270 --> 09:24.390
And so you

09:24.960 --> 09:26.910
hid your true abilities,

09:27.510 --> 09:29.480
secretly controlled everything,

09:30.270 --> 09:31.790
and decided matters of life and death.

09:32.360 --> 09:34.480
I've invited you here

09:34.910 --> 09:36.150
to ask you

09:37.870 --> 09:39.200
if you recognize this person.

09:43.120 --> 09:45.120
Stop beating around the bush.

09:46.720 --> 09:47.960
I bought

09:48.670 --> 09:50.150
this poison myself.

09:51.080 --> 09:53.320
But as for poisoning a child,

09:53.630 --> 09:55.390
I would never do such a thing.

09:55.870 --> 09:57.390
So, you mean to say

09:58.270 --> 09:59.870
you weren't trying to harm me?

10:00.390 --> 10:01.480
That's right.

10:04.000 --> 10:05.320
This poison

10:07.200 --> 10:10.320
was meant for Xiao Juechong.

10:10.960 --> 10:13.120
You've always resented my father.

10:14.870 --> 10:16.720
Prince Qian

10:18.870 --> 10:21.870
was the Empress Dowager's
eldest legitimate son.

10:25.080 --> 10:26.550
That Xiao Juechong

10:28.120 --> 10:31.960
is merely an adopted son raised
under the Empress Dowager's name.

10:32.030 --> 10:35.720
The Empress Dowager treated him
as her own.

10:36.240 --> 10:37.910
And Prince Qian

10:37.960 --> 10:41.270
cared for him deeply
and taught him with great care.

10:41.840 --> 10:43.960
But he took advantage
of the chaos of war

10:44.030 --> 10:46.480
(Yunzhou City)
and was treacherous and ungrateful.

10:55.940 --> 10:58.180
(Young Duke of Ying)

11:03.270 --> 11:04.790
All soldiers, hear my command!

11:05.200 --> 11:05.910
- Yes!
- Yes!

11:06.030 --> 11:07.240
March out!

11:07.400 --> 11:08.280
- Yes!
- Yes!

11:15.440 --> 11:16.480
What's the situation?

11:16.510 --> 11:18.310
We've sent out
several more groups of scouts.

11:18.320 --> 11:19.790
Prince Qian is blessed by the heavens.

11:19.824 --> 11:21.070
He'll surely return victorious.

11:22.580 --> 11:24.060
(Yunzhou City)

11:24.080 --> 11:25.000
It's the signal.

11:25.056 --> 11:26.440
Assemble the troops
and open the city gates!

11:26.440 --> 11:27.310
Reinforce Prince Qian!

11:27.320 --> 11:28.064
- Yes!
- Yes!

11:28.630 --> 11:29.240
Quickly!

11:29.240 --> 11:29.670
Wait!

11:36.200 --> 11:38.000
All soldiers of the army,

11:39.600 --> 11:41.480
defend the city to the death.

11:41.520 --> 11:42.600
What are you talking about?

11:42.600 --> 11:43.720
- Duke of Ying.
- Don't be rash.

11:43.720 --> 11:45.480
- Prince Qian is surrounded!
- Duke of Ying.

11:45.480 --> 11:47.440
Are we just going to stand by
and watch him die?

11:47.450 --> 11:49.960
- Archers, nock your arrows.
- Are you going to watch Prince Qian

11:49.970 --> 11:50.949
die on the battlefield?

11:51.030 --> 11:51.960
The city gates...

11:52.240 --> 11:54.000
He is your older brother!

11:54.150 --> 11:55.670
Your older brother!

11:55.670 --> 11:56.840
Must not

11:58.080 --> 11:59.840
be opened!

12:00.600 --> 12:01.510
What are you doing?

13:07.910 --> 13:08.910
Qian!

13:09.630 --> 13:10.670
Qian!

13:11.200 --> 13:12.550
Qian!

13:13.080 --> 13:15.390
He refused to send reinforcements.

13:16.320 --> 13:18.150
With vicious ambition,

13:20.270 --> 13:21.720
he caused Prince Qian's death,

13:21.720 --> 13:23.360
then claimed the throne himself!

13:23.360 --> 13:24.200
How dare you!

13:24.944 --> 13:26.830
My imperial uncle died
on the battlefield.

13:26.840 --> 13:28.848
How can you misplace your anger
on my father?

13:38.840 --> 13:40.790
That Xiao Juechong

13:42.790 --> 13:46.550
had long coveted the throne.

13:49.390 --> 13:51.600
It's just that Prince Qian

13:53.200 --> 13:55.120
was too kind and benevolent.

13:55.440 --> 13:58.360
He never once suspected
his younger brother.

14:00.000 --> 14:01.200
As for me,

14:01.790 --> 14:04.720
I was Prince Qian's second-in-command.

14:08.270 --> 14:10.870
My only goal was to avenge him.

14:13.790 --> 14:15.240
But I never expected

14:16.870 --> 14:18.200
that this poison

14:19.870 --> 14:22.720
would be used by someone else
to do their dirty work.

14:27.750 --> 14:28.790
What do you mean?

14:30.360 --> 14:33.150
As for who wanted to poison you,

14:34.510 --> 14:36.480
I didn't see it with my own eyes.

14:38.600 --> 14:40.870
I cannot say for sure.

14:42.870 --> 14:45.550
I can only offer you
one piece of advice.

14:47.150 --> 14:50.120
Do not place too much trust

14:51.910 --> 14:53.600
in your father.

14:55.080 --> 14:57.960
In his heart, there is only the throne.

14:59.630 --> 15:00.870
There is no

15:03.150 --> 15:04.440
brotherhood...

15:07.600 --> 15:08.840
let alone

15:10.750 --> 15:12.390
the bond between father and son...

15:48.270 --> 15:49.080
Your Highness,

15:50.600 --> 15:52.360
how do you plan to handle this next?

15:59.630 --> 16:00.840
Duke of Ying

16:01.670 --> 16:03.720
was a renowned general, as famous as

16:03.720 --> 16:05.488
the Duke of Wei
and the Marquis of Shunan.

16:06.510 --> 16:07.670
He committed a crime

16:08.270 --> 16:10.270
and has paid for it with his life.

16:10.630 --> 16:11.840
His remains

16:13.240 --> 16:15.000
should be buried in his ancestral tomb.

16:27.536 --> 16:29.320
Your Highness, you seem to regret this.

16:29.840 --> 16:30.600
Yes.

16:33.150 --> 16:33.960
This time,

16:35.720 --> 16:38.630
I thought the Duke of Ying
was the real poisoner.

16:39.270 --> 16:40.200
I didn't expect

16:41.870 --> 16:43.120
it would all be for nothing.

16:43.870 --> 16:45.390
What the Duke of Ying said

16:46.320 --> 16:47.480
implicated His Majesty.

16:51.152 --> 16:53.200
It was because that bowl
of cherries in sweet cream

16:54.030 --> 16:55.790
was personally fed to me by my father.

16:57.150 --> 16:58.440
This isn't the first time

16:58.670 --> 16:59.960
I've heard these rumors.

17:00.750 --> 17:02.150
But I remember clearly.

17:03.150 --> 17:04.270
When I was five,

17:04.592 --> 17:06.310
I was in danger during the spring hunt.

17:06.590 --> 17:08.000
I was attacked by a wild wolf.

17:08.750 --> 17:10.480
My father risked his life to save me.

17:11.440 --> 17:13.030
He was covered in blood.

17:13.720 --> 17:16.160
When I was little, I'd cry all night.

17:17.000 --> 17:18.590
To lull me to sleep,

17:18.624 --> 17:19.960
my father would gently pat my back

17:19.960 --> 17:20.920
and stay up all night.

17:22.310 --> 17:23.200
One day,

17:23.550 --> 17:24.750
I caught a cold.

17:24.960 --> 17:26.640
To take better care of me,

17:27.880 --> 17:28.880
he reviewed his memorials

17:28.960 --> 17:30.680
at my bedside.

17:34.110 --> 17:35.310
In my heart,

17:36.240 --> 17:37.750
he is the best father there is.

17:39.160 --> 17:40.110
Well then, today,

17:40.200 --> 17:41.904
at least we've ruled out
the Duke of Ying.

17:42.000 --> 17:43.510
We're one step closer to the truth.

17:44.944 --> 17:46.310
Are you trying to comfort me?

17:48.928 --> 17:50.464
We're investigating this case together.

17:50.736 --> 17:52.070
We'll face it all, thick and thin.

17:52.960 --> 17:54.270
Even if we find nothing,

17:54.510 --> 17:56.400
I don't want to see you so disheartened.

18:05.728 --> 18:08.160
For more than ten years,
I've been investigating this case.

18:08.830 --> 18:10.350
The loneliness I've felt,

18:10.830 --> 18:11.790
the loss,

18:12.110 --> 18:13.000
the confusion,

18:14.000 --> 18:15.160
and even the despair,

18:16.720 --> 18:17.960
no one has ever known.

18:20.110 --> 18:21.350
Since I was nine,

18:21.960 --> 18:23.790
I had forgotten what joy felt like.

18:25.480 --> 18:26.400
But now,

18:27.920 --> 18:28.680
I know.

18:29.300 --> 18:31.550
♪Frost that melts at a single smile♪

18:32.870 --> 18:38.150
♪How can you be this wonderful♪

18:39.940 --> 18:42.780
♪Every answer I gave♪

18:43.580 --> 18:46.420
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

18:47.220 --> 18:50.580
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

18:50.820 --> 18:54.140
♪How hard it truly was?♪

18:57.100 --> 19:00.540
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

19:01.530 --> 19:03.620
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

19:03.640 --> 19:04.880
Can you not take it off?

19:04.880 --> 19:07.880
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

19:11.000 --> 19:12.640
I know you're feeling down,

19:13.510 --> 19:15.000
so I won't hold it against you.

19:15.640 --> 19:18.260
♪You'll never♪

19:18.400 --> 19:19.790
Thank you for your compassion.

19:21.920 --> 19:23.680
Your kindness to me today

19:24.096 --> 19:26.144
is something I'll remember
for the rest of my life.

19:44.820 --> 19:46.380
(Duke of Wei's Manor)

19:50.880 --> 19:52.960
Your Highnesses, what brings you here?

19:53.270 --> 19:54.550
My brother and I have come...

19:55.880 --> 19:57.160
First, to thank you,

19:58.680 --> 19:59.480
and second,

20:01.440 --> 20:02.590
to bid you farewell.

20:02.590 --> 20:03.510
Farewell?

20:03.840 --> 20:05.070
Regarding my uncle's matter,

20:05.510 --> 20:06.680
I know it was you

20:06.680 --> 20:08.270
and Crown Prince who mediated,

20:08.270 --> 20:10.368
allowing my uncle to be buried
in the ancestral tomb.

20:10.400 --> 20:12.590
The Valiant Army
wasn't implicated either.

20:13.400 --> 20:15.110
Although the Duke of Ying
made a mistake,

20:15.550 --> 20:16.880
it doesn't erase

20:16.880 --> 20:18.440
all of his past merits.

20:19.240 --> 20:20.550
He deserves to be respected.

20:23.030 --> 20:24.350
With my uncle gone,

20:24.896 --> 20:26.790
the Valiant Army
will inevitably face turmoil.

20:26.848 --> 20:27.920
I have requested a decree
from my father.

20:27.920 --> 20:29.870
I'm going to take my uncle's place
guarding Anlan.

20:29.880 --> 20:31.248
My father has already approved it.

20:32.030 --> 20:33.720
I will lead my troops out tomorrow.

20:33.792 --> 20:34.920
You've made up your mind?

20:36.544 --> 20:39.200
I've lived under the protection
of my uncle and my older brother.

20:39.200 --> 20:39.960
Now,

20:40.880 --> 20:41.880
my uncle has passed away,

20:42.048 --> 20:43.440
and my mother has been demoted.

20:44.030 --> 20:46.110
I can't let my brother
manage everything alone.

20:47.000 --> 20:48.240
I'll go guard Anlan,

20:48.288 --> 20:49.830
while Changping stays in the capital

20:49.904 --> 20:51.776
to handle the aftermath
of the secret prison.

20:52.440 --> 20:53.880
The Duke of Ying's Valiant Army,

20:54.030 --> 20:58.000
which struck fear into the hearts
of our enemies, is now in your hands.

20:58.200 --> 20:59.750
The Duke of Ying's spirit in heaven

20:59.790 --> 21:00.920
will be gratified.

21:03.000 --> 21:04.790
After this parting, we'll be far apart.

21:05.510 --> 21:07.030
I don't know when we'll meet again.

21:08.480 --> 21:09.350
I hope that you

21:09.488 --> 21:10.790
will take good care of yourself

21:11.640 --> 21:12.720
and stay safe.

21:12.750 --> 21:14.720
You too, Your Highness.

21:15.510 --> 21:17.712
Then I wish you success
in the wider world ahead,

21:17.744 --> 21:19.510
and may you achieve great things.

22:09.000 --> 22:10.590
I don't know what's going on.

22:10.608 --> 22:13.168
My dad suddenly wants to send me
to the Court of Judicial Review.

22:14.270 --> 22:16.200
What terrible thing did you do?
Did your father

22:16.224 --> 22:17.900
turn you in for the greater good?

22:17.940 --> 22:19.390
(Wang Jue, Marquis of Zhenbei's Son)
I don't know.

22:19.400 --> 22:21.990
He found out there was an
opening at the Court of Judicial Review.

22:22.000 --> 22:24.050
Why don't you pretend
to be sick and get out of it?

22:24.300 --> 22:26.480
The Court of Judicial Review
has issued the order.

22:26.496 --> 22:27.690
I've been officially accepted.

22:28.070 --> 22:30.070
Aren't you close with Vice Minister Cui?

22:30.510 --> 22:32.030
Can you put in a good word for me?

22:32.030 --> 22:34.480
Anyone can do an easy job like that.

22:35.270 --> 22:37.400
Can you ask him to let me off the hook?

22:41.510 --> 22:43.750
Best Young Master in the whole world,

22:43.880 --> 22:45.240
please save me.

22:47.640 --> 22:49.880
Seeing how sincerely you're begging me,

22:49.880 --> 22:51.110
I'll help you out.

22:51.480 --> 22:53.510
Although Vice Minister Cui is stubborn,

22:53.510 --> 22:54.510
he'll still listen

22:54.590 --> 22:56.510
to what I have to say.

22:57.056 --> 22:58.128
You're a true friend.

22:58.590 --> 22:59.440
No.

23:00.144 --> 23:02.000
Wang Jue is useless
at both books and brawls.

23:02.000 --> 23:03.880
He'll cause trouble for you later.

23:03.880 --> 23:05.720
He's happier being a playboy.

23:05.750 --> 23:06.590
Please reconsider.

23:06.720 --> 23:08.070
I said no, and I mean it.

23:12.510 --> 23:14.750
Come on, we've been
through thick and thin together.

23:18.550 --> 23:19.880
I thought you'd forgotten.

23:24.680 --> 23:25.270
Come.

23:28.030 --> 23:28.680
Go!

23:29.750 --> 23:30.350
Stop.

23:30.350 --> 23:31.240
Beat him!

23:37.480 --> 23:40.030
Don't be so unreasonable.

23:40.500 --> 23:42.950
Organizing case files doesn't require
literary or martial skill.

23:42.960 --> 23:44.080
He just needs to be literate.

23:47.720 --> 23:50.270
Why is there a sudden opening
at the Court of Judicial Review?

23:52.750 --> 23:55.270
Do you think that the day
after you mentioned Wang Jue to me,

23:55.270 --> 23:57.290
he got transferred
to the Court of Judicial Review,

23:57.310 --> 23:59.070
so he can no longer
fool around with you,

23:59.440 --> 24:00.790
is quite a coincidence?

24:01.720 --> 24:02.680
Young Master,

24:03.160 --> 24:05.070
aren't you flattering yourself?

24:05.440 --> 24:06.960
This opening has always been there.

24:07.160 --> 24:08.440
It's perfect for someone

24:08.440 --> 24:10.200
who is physically weak,

24:10.270 --> 24:11.200
can't speak well,

24:11.790 --> 24:12.920
and isn't very bright.

24:19.440 --> 24:20.510
Are you mocking me?

24:24.270 --> 24:25.110
Cui Jinbai,

24:25.110 --> 24:26.110
have you forgotten

24:26.110 --> 24:28.070
what it's like to be under me?

24:30.640 --> 24:32.790
It seems you have fully recovered.

24:33.400 --> 24:35.350
If you're so loyal to your friend,

24:35.408 --> 24:37.152
why don't you switch places
with Wang Jue?

24:39.680 --> 24:41.310
Organizing case files isn't hard at all.

24:52.080 --> 24:54.752
You just need to number the files
as you organize them.

24:55.880 --> 24:56.440
One.

24:58.210 --> 25:00.780
♪The moonlight is sewn together
by the dusk♪

25:00.830 --> 25:01.400
Two.

25:08.960 --> 25:09.790
No, no.

25:10.960 --> 25:12.350
My chest hurts, my hand hurts, too.

25:13.030 --> 25:14.400
It looks like I won't be better

25:14.400 --> 25:15.424
for at least half a month.

25:15.590 --> 25:17.110
I won't disturb you any longer.

25:39.480 --> 25:40.510
Why are you blushing?

25:42.680 --> 25:44.960
My condition is getting worse.
I have shortness of breath.

25:44.960 --> 25:46.510
I must go back and lie down.

25:46.510 --> 25:48.680
I won't disturb you
while you're on duty.

25:54.270 --> 25:54.960
Did you hear?

25:54.960 --> 25:56.200
Duke of Wei has returned.

25:56.200 --> 25:58.480
(Mingde Gate)
The Duke of Wei is so impressive.

26:01.440 --> 26:02.440
Here he comes!

26:02.480 --> 26:03.110
Quick, look!

26:03.110 --> 26:04.440
That's the Duke of Wei.

26:07.680 --> 26:08.400
Youyou!

26:13.340 --> 26:16.180
(Shen Yueshan, Duke of Wei)

26:35.880 --> 26:36.590
Father.

26:36.640 --> 26:38.352
Now that you're in the imperial capital,

26:38.590 --> 26:40.310
you've become so mature.

26:41.070 --> 26:42.070
You're no longer the same

26:42.070 --> 26:43.720
boisterous little girl you used to be.

26:44.030 --> 26:45.030
But,

26:45.480 --> 26:47.160
who told you to wait at the city gate?

26:47.440 --> 26:48.480
The wind is so strong.

26:49.000 --> 26:50.720
What if you catch a cold?

26:51.216 --> 26:53.510
The imperial capital
is thousands of miles from northwest.

26:53.750 --> 26:55.030
I was worried about you.

26:55.310 --> 26:56.880
I also wanted to see you sooner.

26:58.070 --> 27:00.790
Don't be so willful again.

27:02.880 --> 27:04.790
Father, let's go back to the manor.

27:08.830 --> 27:10.830
That the Duke of Wei's daughter

27:11.640 --> 27:12.960
is to ride in such a carriage,

27:13.680 --> 27:15.160
isn't it a bit too delicate?

27:17.110 --> 27:18.110
Youyou,

27:18.384 --> 27:19.640
tell me, does your brother

27:19.640 --> 27:21.440
hold a grudge against me
from a past life?

27:21.590 --> 27:23.110
All he does is anger me.

27:23.310 --> 27:25.920
I already told him
that of all the princes,

27:25.920 --> 27:28.350
you must not choose
that sickly Crown Prince.

27:28.960 --> 27:30.070
But he told me

27:30.240 --> 27:32.790
that the Crown Prince
is the most suitable man for you.

27:35.920 --> 27:36.920
Youyou,

27:38.440 --> 27:39.350
you...

27:39.350 --> 27:41.110
are not really going
to marry him, are you?

27:43.088 --> 27:45.070
His Majesty has already
decreed the marriage.

27:45.510 --> 27:47.200
Can you really call it off, Father?

27:47.200 --> 27:48.640
For my precious daughter,

27:48.640 --> 27:50.160
is there anything your father can't do?

27:52.160 --> 27:53.350
Let's return to the manor.

27:53.350 --> 27:55.400
I'll wash up
and change my clothes first.

27:55.400 --> 27:57.920
Then I'll go to the palace
to pay my respects to His Majesty.

27:58.030 --> 27:59.590
I want to see for myself

28:00.200 --> 28:01.750
who this Crown Prince is.

28:05.460 --> 28:06.580
(Taiji Hall)

28:06.590 --> 28:08.510
Duke of Wei has arrived.

28:15.830 --> 28:17.680
Greetings, Your Majesty.

28:17.760 --> 28:19.312
May Your Majesty be in good health.

28:19.720 --> 28:20.720
Yueshan,

28:20.920 --> 28:22.440
dispense with the formalities.

28:25.270 --> 28:27.880
You're still as robust
as you were back then.

28:28.200 --> 28:30.310
You entrusted northwest to me.

28:30.350 --> 28:32.270
I could only do my utmost.

28:33.640 --> 28:34.960
With you there,

28:35.510 --> 28:36.880
northwest is safe.

28:38.110 --> 28:39.000
Huayong,

28:39.000 --> 28:41.790
Duke of Wei and I are sworn brothers.

28:42.030 --> 28:44.270
Quickly, pay your respects
to your honorary uncle.

28:44.960 --> 28:47.184
Honorary Uncle,
you've worked hard guarding the border.

28:47.568 --> 28:50.240
When I reviewed northwest military
reports at the Ministry of War,

28:50.240 --> 28:53.088
I often came across your brilliant
strategies. I have long admired you.

28:55.960 --> 28:56.880
You flatter me.

28:58.160 --> 29:00.160
Your Highness, you are of royal blood.

29:00.160 --> 29:02.480
Your words do me too much honor.

29:04.070 --> 29:05.920
Yueshan, you're too modest.

29:06.030 --> 29:07.400
You deserve the praise.

29:07.440 --> 29:08.550
From now on,

29:08.550 --> 29:10.310
we will be in-laws.

29:10.310 --> 29:12.880
Huayong will be like a son to you.

29:15.960 --> 29:17.030
Xihe

29:17.680 --> 29:20.310
grew up by my side.

29:21.640 --> 29:22.790
Northwest is a harsh place,

29:22.790 --> 29:24.960
so I couldn't help but dote on her.

29:25.350 --> 29:28.200
That made her spoiled and headstrong.

29:29.904 --> 29:30.920
When I wasn't around,

29:30.920 --> 29:33.270
she willfully agreed to this marriage.

29:33.960 --> 29:36.240
I am worried

29:36.790 --> 29:38.480
that she might offend Crown Prince.

29:38.960 --> 29:39.750
Honorary Uncle,

29:40.070 --> 29:41.400
Xihe is exceptionally intelligent,

29:41.550 --> 29:42.640
bold, and decisive.

29:42.920 --> 29:45.240
As for our marriage,
we both thought it through carefully.

29:45.312 --> 29:46.832
We are certain about each other.

30:04.680 --> 30:05.790
Your Highness,

30:06.680 --> 30:08.110
forgive my bluntness,

30:08.880 --> 30:10.550
but your face is fairer than a maiden's,

30:10.550 --> 30:12.832
and your features
are as fine as a painting. Your build

30:13.280 --> 30:14.480
doesn't look very sturdy.

30:14.480 --> 30:16.720
You are truly not my ideal choice
for a son-in-law.

30:18.750 --> 30:20.480
Any father who considers his daughter

30:20.750 --> 30:22.070
the apple of his eye

30:22.790 --> 30:23.480
would find fault

30:23.480 --> 30:25.440
with the man
who marries his precious treasure.

30:25.750 --> 30:27.350
The fact that you love Xihe so dearly

30:27.350 --> 30:29.240
makes me very happy.

30:33.830 --> 30:36.240
I have always held my daughter
in the palm of my hand,

30:36.960 --> 30:38.510
guarding her carefully.

30:38.590 --> 30:40.432
Of course, I must
entrust her to someone...

30:42.640 --> 30:44.510
who can protect her.

30:44.960 --> 30:46.750
I have also mastered martial arts.

30:46.920 --> 30:48.880
Some other day,
I will seek your guidance.

30:49.480 --> 30:50.400
You?

31:02.270 --> 31:03.070
Fine.

31:04.550 --> 31:06.310
Some other day, we will

31:07.200 --> 31:08.510
have a friendly match.

31:11.070 --> 31:12.070
Thank you.

31:14.310 --> 31:15.830
Your Highness,

31:16.640 --> 31:17.920
don't thank me too soon.

31:18.640 --> 31:19.880
My daughter

31:20.350 --> 31:22.880
isn't someone
who can be married off so easily.

31:23.550 --> 31:24.880
The Crown Prince is no exception.

31:33.510 --> 31:34.640
Take care.

31:38.340 --> 31:40.740
(Duke of Wei's Manor)

31:41.160 --> 31:42.000
Youyou,

31:42.680 --> 31:43.640
I'm back.

31:44.350 --> 31:45.830
Greetings, Father.

31:53.440 --> 31:54.750
Have you had your evening meal?

31:55.400 --> 31:57.640
Xihe prepared dinner for me.

31:57.720 --> 31:58.960
In that case,

31:59.440 --> 32:00.640
it's getting late.

32:01.200 --> 32:02.310
You should rest early.

32:02.750 --> 32:05.000
If you need anything, just find Qing.

32:05.200 --> 32:07.000
Then, Father,
you should also rest early.

32:07.920 --> 32:09.000
I...

32:09.232 --> 32:10.960
will come pay my respects again
tomorrow.

32:25.550 --> 32:26.270
Youyou.

32:26.550 --> 32:27.200
Father.

32:27.350 --> 32:28.110
You're here.

32:28.590 --> 32:30.440
I just saw Ruo was here.

32:30.480 --> 32:32.680
Why did you let her go
after just a few words?

32:33.240 --> 32:34.000
Sit down first.

32:39.110 --> 32:40.880
Because of Xiao,

32:41.640 --> 32:44.750
I don't know how to face Ruo,

32:45.590 --> 32:48.400
let alone how to dote on her.

32:52.680 --> 32:53.480
Father,

32:54.510 --> 32:55.790
since I came to the manor

32:55.790 --> 32:56.720
and met Ruo,

32:57.160 --> 32:59.960
she is indeed intelligent,
gentle, and well-mannered.

33:00.064 --> 33:02.200
Her mother's evil deeds
have nothing to do with her.

33:02.300 --> 33:03.960
You shouldn't
take your anger out on her.

33:04.200 --> 33:05.920
If you just spend more time with her,

33:05.984 --> 33:08.160
you'll naturally figure out
how to get along with her.

33:12.960 --> 33:13.920
Xihe,

33:14.720 --> 33:15.680
I...

33:16.400 --> 33:17.830
really feel that you've changed.

33:22.720 --> 33:25.240
But I find it very strange.

33:25.830 --> 33:28.240
Why did you agree
to marry the Crown Prince?

33:28.350 --> 33:29.856
He's just as the rumors say,

33:29.856 --> 33:31.720
like a willow in the wind,
fragile and weak.

33:31.720 --> 33:33.792
How could he become
a son-in-law of the northwest?

33:38.680 --> 33:39.750
What?

33:41.350 --> 33:43.030
I say a few words about him,

33:43.030 --> 33:44.336
and you're already displeased?

33:44.590 --> 33:45.680
Of course not.

33:49.070 --> 33:50.160
Then tell me,

33:50.310 --> 33:52.960
did you fall for the Crown Prince
just for his looks?

33:54.830 --> 33:55.440
Yes,

33:56.590 --> 33:57.400
he is

33:58.440 --> 33:59.920
quite handsome.

34:00.600 --> 34:03.160
Only a real man like your father

34:03.240 --> 34:04.510
and brothers will do.

34:05.160 --> 34:06.000
It's my fault.

34:06.200 --> 34:07.720
It's my fault for losing my mind

34:07.792 --> 34:09.590
and sending you to the imperial capital.

34:12.070 --> 34:15.670
But have you seen
the Crown Prince's legs and arms?

34:15.710 --> 34:16.928
They're too skinny.

34:16.960 --> 34:19.390
With those skinny legs and arms,
one push and he'd fall over.

34:19.400 --> 34:20.510
When I was talking to him,

34:20.510 --> 34:21.710
I was worried my voice was too loud

34:21.710 --> 34:23.344
and that I might scare him
into fainting.

34:23.440 --> 34:24.440
Father,

34:25.280 --> 34:26.590
you're strong and powerful.

34:26.590 --> 34:28.280
Of course, you'd think everyone

34:28.670 --> 34:29.440
You're...

34:30.960 --> 34:32.800
You're defending him.

34:32.920 --> 34:34.480
That's not what I mean.

34:35.070 --> 34:36.960
I'm just being fair.

34:37.320 --> 34:39.670
Besides, I didn't fall for his looks.

34:40.590 --> 34:42.880
I've already explained all the reasons
to my brother.

34:42.880 --> 34:44.480
I'm sure he's already told you.

34:46.590 --> 34:48.590
It's not that I don't trust you.

34:48.920 --> 34:51.590
I don't trust that future son-in-law
of mine.

34:52.840 --> 34:53.710
All right, all right.

34:58.360 --> 34:59.800
You should go back and rest for now.

34:59.920 --> 35:00.710
Tomorrow,

35:01.230 --> 35:03.400
I'll take you to see
your maternal grandfather.

35:05.110 --> 35:08.070
Then I'll find a chance
to size him up for you again.

35:12.660 --> 35:15.540
(Tao Residence)

35:18.550 --> 35:19.630
Xihe.

35:19.880 --> 35:20.880
Father-in-law.

35:21.070 --> 35:21.800
Grandfather.

35:23.070 --> 35:24.800
It seems you're doing well.

35:28.670 --> 35:29.760
Your Highness.

35:34.760 --> 35:37.480
Your Highness, why are you here?

35:37.480 --> 35:40.510
His Highness often comes to visit me.

35:40.510 --> 35:41.590
Early this morning,

35:41.590 --> 35:44.590
he also sent over a meal meticulously
prepared by the East Palace.

35:45.510 --> 35:48.880
I told him Xihe would be back today.

35:50.880 --> 35:51.880
We're all family.

35:51.880 --> 35:52.960
Minister Tao, Duke of Wei,

35:52.960 --> 35:54.150
you can just call me Huayong.

35:57.590 --> 35:58.960
My esteemed Father-in-law,

35:59.150 --> 36:01.190
I have come to pay my respects.

36:01.440 --> 36:03.710
You're only here
for a short three-day stay.

36:03.840 --> 36:05.760
You didn't need to make a special trip.

36:06.030 --> 36:08.440
You could have just had Xihe
relay a message.

36:08.560 --> 36:10.060
Now that I'm in the imperial capital,

36:10.070 --> 36:12.030
it would be improper
not to pay a formal visit.

36:12.048 --> 36:13.360
I may be a crude man,

36:13.360 --> 36:15.510
but I still know basic etiquette.

36:16.280 --> 36:17.360
Xihe, come on.

36:17.360 --> 36:18.320
Let's go inside.

36:27.800 --> 36:29.800
I see

36:29.920 --> 36:31.344
you've lost so much weight.

36:31.376 --> 36:33.030
I have lost a little weight recently.

36:33.030 --> 36:34.440
It seems you are already used to

36:34.440 --> 36:35.952
being scorned by your father-in-law.

36:38.710 --> 36:39.760
But don't worry.

36:40.070 --> 36:41.110
Before long,

36:41.110 --> 36:43.190
you'll be able
to act like a father-in-law yourself.

36:48.030 --> 36:49.550
This rascal.

36:50.110 --> 36:52.230
He's cunning from head to toe.

36:52.672 --> 36:53.960
He's not to be underestimated.

36:54.550 --> 36:56.110
He's just like a northwestern wolf.

36:57.920 --> 36:59.000
Grandfather.

36:59.480 --> 37:01.670
Where are Uncle, Aunt, and Xun?

37:01.744 --> 37:04.030
Your uncle's father-in-law
is celebrating his birthday,

37:04.030 --> 37:06.110
so he went with your aunt and Xun

37:06.280 --> 37:07.400
to her family's home.

37:07.630 --> 37:08.800
See?

37:09.000 --> 37:11.590
For decades, he's been the same.

37:11.800 --> 37:14.510
Attentive and doting on his wife.

37:14.760 --> 37:16.280
That's a truly great son-in-law.

37:16.670 --> 37:17.670
He is.

37:18.360 --> 37:20.070
Unlike some people

37:20.150 --> 37:21.710
who are so thoughtless.

37:22.352 --> 37:24.480
I call it being meticulous
beneath a rough exterior.

37:24.630 --> 37:25.880
Lacking composure.

37:25.880 --> 37:28.000
I call it being bold and unrestrained.

37:29.030 --> 37:31.000
You're over a hundred years old
combined.

37:31.190 --> 37:33.110
Why are you still bickering
like children?

37:33.110 --> 37:34.590
Father, coming to Grandfather's house

37:34.913 --> 37:36.833
has made you quite eloquent
and argumentative.

37:37.880 --> 37:40.070
Please excuse us, Your Highness.

37:40.230 --> 37:41.590
Minister Tao, you and Duke of Wei

37:41.590 --> 37:42.880
don't treat me like a stranger.

37:42.880 --> 37:44.320
This lively atmosphere

37:44.320 --> 37:45.790
is what makes it feel like a family.

37:46.000 --> 37:47.280
It's truly heartwarming.

37:49.030 --> 37:50.840
As long as you are willing,

37:51.150 --> 37:53.150
the Tao family will always welcome you.

37:54.192 --> 37:55.616
Thank you, Minister Tao.

37:57.280 --> 37:58.860
Since returning to the imperial capital,

37:59.590 --> 38:02.110
I've received so much care
from you and Xihe.

38:02.784 --> 38:04.900
I've been using the aromatic bath
Xihe prepared for me

38:04.960 --> 38:07.320
every day. My knees
don't even hurt anymore.

38:07.760 --> 38:09.320
The scented charcoal Xihe sent me

38:09.320 --> 38:10.590
is especially fragrant

38:10.630 --> 38:11.550
and long-lasting.

38:11.670 --> 38:13.424
Much better than what we have
in the palace.

38:13.936 --> 38:15.500
I've always been sensitive to the cold,

38:15.590 --> 38:17.670
so this winter has been
much more comfortable.

38:18.360 --> 38:18.880
Besides,

38:18.976 --> 38:20.840
the sachet Xihe gave me
is very refreshing.

38:20.960 --> 38:22.070
I smell it every day,

38:22.150 --> 38:23.280
and it keeps my spirits high.

38:23.312 --> 38:25.920
I've been much sharper and
more efficient in handling my duties.

38:26.550 --> 38:28.230
Father, Grandfather,

38:29.320 --> 38:32.070
I suddenly feel like making a few dishes
to go with our drinks.

38:32.080 --> 38:33.490
- Absolutely not.
- Absolutely not.

38:34.630 --> 38:36.000
There's an outsider here.

38:36.096 --> 38:37.776
Why should we let him get a free meal?

38:37.800 --> 38:39.000
In a few days,

38:39.880 --> 38:41.760
when a certain someone is long gone,

38:42.040 --> 38:43.890
you can make fewer dishes.

38:44.400 --> 38:46.000
You don't have to work so hard.

38:46.670 --> 38:48.070
The wontons Xihe made for me

38:48.190 --> 38:49.230
were exquisite.

38:49.230 --> 38:50.288
I learned by watching her

38:50.320 --> 38:52.496
and have been practicing diligently
at the East Palace.

38:52.510 --> 38:53.550
How about

38:53.840 --> 38:55.110
you try my handiwork today?

38:56.752 --> 38:58.670
Then we'll have to trouble you,
Your Highness.

39:05.872 --> 39:07.840
Our elders still have things to discuss.

39:07.920 --> 39:09.776
Let's go to the kitchen
and make wontons.

39:13.590 --> 39:15.000
Northwestern wolf.

39:15.400 --> 39:16.190
Northwestern wolf.

39:23.150 --> 39:24.670
I thought when the Duke of Wei arrived,

39:24.670 --> 39:26.480
you'd send him directly
to see my father.

39:26.736 --> 39:27.920
Don't read too much into it.

39:28.010 --> 39:29.840
I don't want to cause trouble
for my father,

39:30.190 --> 39:32.280
nor do I want His Majesty
to be displeased with him.

39:32.672 --> 39:34.440
But the Duke of Wei was very direct
with me

39:34.440 --> 39:35.440
about his disapproval.

39:36.190 --> 39:37.230
but didn't mention

39:38.760 --> 39:39.670
your concerns.

39:39.800 --> 39:40.670
I suppose

39:40.920 --> 39:42.000
you never told him

39:42.112 --> 39:43.440
that you don't want to marry me.

39:45.550 --> 39:46.840
For some troublesome people,

39:46.840 --> 39:47.840
I clean up my own mess.

39:48.704 --> 39:50.176
I don't pass the buck to my father.

39:57.232 --> 39:59.152
The way you say one thing
but mean another

39:59.510 --> 40:00.590
is always so cute.

40:08.760 --> 40:11.190
I've really never seen Youyou like this.

40:12.510 --> 40:14.550
Standing next to that northwestern wolf,

40:15.190 --> 40:16.800
they really look like a pair

40:17.070 --> 40:19.070
of loving newlyweds.

40:21.440 --> 40:22.320
What am I saying?

40:28.820 --> 40:31.140
(Residence of the Heir
of the Marquis of Shunan)

40:57.670 --> 40:59.320
Young Master, it's time to eat.

41:01.880 --> 41:02.800
I'm not hungry.

41:03.760 --> 41:05.792
You see, now that the secret prison case
is solved,

41:05.808 --> 41:07.480
Commandery Princess Zhaoning
found the time

41:07.480 --> 41:08.360
to take care of you.

41:08.510 --> 41:10.550
This was sent from Duke of Wei's Manor.

41:12.150 --> 41:13.480
Did Xihe make it?

41:14.800 --> 41:16.280
Not to eat something made by Xihe

41:16.280 --> 41:17.630
would be such a shame. I'll eat.

41:28.070 --> 41:30.800
The Duke of Wei has returned
to the capital recently

41:31.760 --> 41:34.000
and Xihe still has time
to make porridge for me?

41:46.070 --> 41:46.760
Delicious.

42:02.000 --> 42:04.000
Young Master ate the whole bowl
of porridge.

42:04.400 --> 42:05.670
He even said it tasted good.

42:06.224 --> 42:07.510
Then I'll bring more tomorrow.

42:08.110 --> 42:10.112
Then I'll have to trouble you,
Vice Minister Cui.

42:11.670 --> 42:13.880
You traitorous backstabber!

42:14.000 --> 42:16.360
You'll just pass along things
from anyone, won't you?

42:17.480 --> 42:18.760
Don't give Jin Shan a hard time.

42:19.670 --> 42:20.920
I told him to hide it.

42:20.920 --> 42:21.760
You're injured.

42:21.760 --> 42:24.230
If you don't eat more,
how will your wound heal quickly?

42:24.280 --> 42:26.440
What does my recovery
have to do with you?

42:29.840 --> 42:31.000
What are you looking at?

42:33.760 --> 42:36.000
You're the one
sneaking into my residence,

42:36.400 --> 42:37.800
and you think you're in the right?

42:39.190 --> 42:40.190
You're right.

42:40.800 --> 42:42.070
Why should I be sneaky?

42:42.400 --> 42:43.880
I'll just go in openly.

42:44.464 --> 42:46.432
You just wait.
I'll settle the score with you.

42:46.550 --> 42:47.510
- No...
- Stone Cui.

42:48.280 --> 42:49.480
Vice Minister Cui.

42:50.920 --> 42:52.000
Vice Minister Cui!

42:53.190 --> 42:54.000
Stone Cui.

42:55.710 --> 42:56.670
You may leave.

42:56.670 --> 42:57.440
Go.

43:04.320 --> 43:05.070
Cui Jinbai.

43:07.070 --> 43:07.960
Listen to me.

43:08.230 --> 43:09.760
I was wrong before.

43:09.808 --> 43:11.744
I shouldn't have,
in order to avoid the princess,

43:11.792 --> 43:12.710
used you as a shield.

43:13.110 --> 43:13.760
Don't worry.

43:13.760 --> 43:14.510
From now on,

43:14.550 --> 43:16.192
I absolutely won't bother you anymore.

43:20.320 --> 43:21.920
Is that all you have to say to me?

43:24.000 --> 43:24.760
That's all.

43:43.670 --> 43:44.550
Listen to me.

43:47.190 --> 43:48.030
Bu Shulin,

43:49.590 --> 43:50.710
I have feelings for you.

43:52.370 --> 43:54.810
♪The story is sketched anew♪

43:54.970 --> 43:58.470
♪The moonlight is sewn together
by the dusk♪

44:00.040 --> 44:01.740
♪The tide engulfs the lines on my palm♪

44:01.840 --> 44:02.590
Are you okay?

44:02.800 --> 44:04.880
♪Pushing me to converge with you♪

44:05.000 --> 44:06.110
Have you gone mad?

44:06.230 --> 44:07.550
We are both men.

44:07.840 --> 44:08.630
Are you?

44:11.400 --> 44:12.280
What do you mean?

44:14.280 --> 44:15.070
Don't worry.

44:15.800 --> 44:17.230
I will never tell anyone.

44:18.230 --> 44:19.280
You have your concerns.

44:19.800 --> 44:20.590
But I

44:20.640 --> 44:22.230
just want you to understand my feelings.

44:22.230 --> 44:23.136
Don't come any closer.

44:23.560 --> 44:25.680
♪Reaching out to touch you♪

44:25.710 --> 44:27.030
I don't care what you know.

44:28.110 --> 44:29.400
But you'd better remember this.

44:29.824 --> 44:31.900
I will always be the heir
of the Marquis of Shunan.

44:31.952 --> 44:32.670
Always.

44:32.680 --> 44:34.750
I swear to the heavens
I won't breathe a single word.

44:34.768 --> 44:35.840
Didn't you hear me clearly?

44:35.984 --> 44:38.280
I said I will always be the heir
of the Marquis of Shunan.

44:40.590 --> 44:41.280
I understand.

44:42.144 --> 44:43.904
You can't let go of your duty to Shunan.

44:43.970 --> 44:45.300
It's okay. I don't care.

44:46.780 --> 44:49.170
♪Without a single word of goodbye♪

44:49.190 --> 44:51.030
You've worked so hard
to get to this position.

44:52.280 --> 44:54.190
I am the sole heir of the Bu family.

44:55.710 --> 44:56.880
We can't be like this.

44:57.480 --> 44:58.400
Don't you forget.

45:00.360 --> 45:01.760
I'm the Deputy Chief of Justice.

45:02.670 --> 45:04.480
Judging character and cases is my duty.

45:05.840 --> 45:06.670
I'm certain

45:07.936 --> 45:09.200
this isn't just wishful thinking.

45:09.360 --> 45:10.030
Get out.

45:10.030 --> 45:11.030
Get out right now.

45:33.670 --> 45:34.800
Remember to eat properly.

46:06.630 --> 46:07.230
Duke of Wei,

46:07.550 --> 46:09.280
I am here to escort you.

46:09.760 --> 46:11.280
To win Xihe's heart,

46:11.280 --> 46:12.880
you must rely on your own abilities.

46:13.000 --> 46:14.920
I won't say another word.

46:15.480 --> 46:17.960
Even if you do everything
to please my father and brother,

46:18.150 --> 46:19.070
it's useless.

46:24.710 --> 46:27.650
♪I've hidden so many words♪

46:28.270 --> 46:31.070
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

46:31.940 --> 46:38.910
♪So never uncover♪

46:39.100 --> 46:41.460
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

46:42.590 --> 46:45.320
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

46:46.280 --> 46:51.620
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

46:53.380 --> 46:56.200
♪Every answer I gave♪

46:57.000 --> 46:59.850
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

47:00.640 --> 47:04.010
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

47:04.270 --> 47:07.580
♪How hard it truly was?♪

47:10.550 --> 47:13.990
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

47:14.980 --> 47:17.310
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

47:18.580 --> 47:24.340
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

47:25.750 --> 47:28.880
♪It's a shame I never could♪

47:29.330 --> 47:32.340
♪Give you a moon in return♪

47:32.450 --> 47:39.090
♪With the same open heart you loved me♪

47:39.090 --> 47:42.760
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

47:43.630 --> 47:46.390
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

47:46.830 --> 47:49.960
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

47:50.400 --> 47:56.350
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

47:57.750 --> 48:01.300
♪You'll never♪

48:01.580 --> 48:11.050
♪Know how much I long to, long to♪

48:37.220 --> 48:40.700
(No animals were harmed
in the making of this film)
